Ratweres are incredibly dangerous, mainly because you risk getting
bitten and turning into a total wimp.  At least if you turn into a
werewolf you're somewhat dangerous; all a ratwere can do is call on
a bunch of his fellow rats (if you have a ring of conflict this is a
surprisingly effective defense; the real monsters are busy attacking
your rats while you run away.)

Praying often helps, if you haven't been too greedy recently.
Garlic and potions of holy water can also be effective.
Alternatively, after being a rat for a while you'll return to human form, 
but you'll keep turning back into a rat until you get rid of the problem.
A ring of polymorph control might help?
Polymorphing into a dragon is possible, but it's not problem-free.
That suit of chain mail may have fit just fine when you were a barbarian,
but it doesn't stretch real well.  If you're engaging in activities
that might turn you into something large, it's worth limiting your
armor to shoes, hats, gloves, and your third-best suit.

